# Kept minimal and deliberately safe rather than exhaustively tight — this repo has 15+
# microservices and two frontends; the goal here is only to strip what's actually large
# (build output, dependency caches, git history), not to hand-pick which module directories
# a given Docker build context needs. Any service building with `context: ..` (see
# deployment/docker/docker-compose.local.yml) still gets the whole repo tree, just without this.
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
.git/
**/*.log
**/.env
**/mail-intake-uploads/
**/cms-attachments/
